></p></li></ol></li><li class="LegClearFix LegContentsPart tocDefaultExpanded   "><p class="LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/Edw8and1Geo6/1/28/part/II">Part II  Construction of Works</a></p><ol><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/Edw8and1Geo6/1/28/section/4">4.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/Edw8and1Geo6/1/28/section/4"> Application for orders under 24 &amp; 25 Vict. c. 45</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/Edw8and1Geo6/1/28/section/5">5.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/Edw8and1Geo6/1/28/section/5"> Adaptation of 24 &amp; 25 Vict. c. 45, &amp;c.</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/Edw8and1Geo6/1/28/section/6">6.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/Edw8and1Geo6/1/28/section/6"> Adaptation of 24 &amp; 25 Vict. c. 47.</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/Edw8and1Geo6/1/28/section/7">7.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/Edw8and1Geo6/1/28/section/7"> Minor works.</a></span></p></li></ol></li><li class="LegClearFix LegContentsPart tocDefaultExpanded   "><p class="LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/Edw8and1Geo6/1/28/part/III">Part III  Maintenance of Marine Works</a></p><ol><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/Edw8and1Geo6/1/28/section/8">8.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/Edw8and1Geo6/1/28/section/8"> Maintenance of marine works.</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/Edw8and1G